returning to 1e numbes. Which wasn't &quot;There were 400&quot; but &quot;There's between 300 and 400&quot;. What that value is actually between those is up to the game really.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-25T15:35:39-08:00","id":1370459,"title":"","content":"Deliberate swerve away from the 2e implimentation of the Solar Bond and the idea that the Lunars were made primarily to compliment their mates.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-26T05:46:14-08:00","id":1370536,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lioness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1370411-how-many-lunar-exaltations-are-there-in-3rd-edition?p=1370459#post1370459\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Deliberate swerve away from the 2e implimentation of the Solar Bond and the idea that the Lunars were made primarily to compliment their mates.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah, so that was another one of THOSE 2ed moments. Actually never knew that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23964-el-barto","name":"El Barto","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"84"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-26T15:50:20-08:00","id":1370676,"title":"","content":"Ah. I see.<br /> <br /> This makes me wounder how many Sidereals there will be.<br /> <br /> On a side note, is the Solar number still fixed at 300?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4428-daredevil","name":"Daredevil","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4428_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"404"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-26T16:59:30-08:00","id":1370684,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Daredevil</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1370411-how-many-lunar-exaltations-are-there-in-3rd-edition?p=1370676#post1370676\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This makes me wounder how many Sidereals there will be.</div> </div> </div> </div>My guess is that the Sids will still be fixed at 100. 1e was more precise about them than either Solars or Lunars - the sobriquet &quot;Fivescore Fellowship&quot; dates back to that period (&quot;Fivescore&quot; means &quot;one hundred&quot;, in case you didn't know).<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Daredevil</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">On a side note, is the Solar number still fixed at 300?</div> </div> </div> </div>I think it's also gone back to 1e numbers, when it was &quot;around 300&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Interested in chatting with other Exalted fans online? Join us on the <a href=\"https://discord.gg/kGsyF5jhdy\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted Discord server</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1533-kelly-pedersen","name":"Kelly Pedersen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1533_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"929"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-27T00:25:29-08:00","id":1370710,"title":"","content":"The numbers in teh 1e STC, as a note for the interested:<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <i>Q: How many Exalted are there?</i><br /> A: As many as you want there to be. As the game was<br /> originally posited, there were more than one hundred and<br /> less than two hundred Solar Exalted. There are between<br /> three and four hundred Lunars, a hundred or so each of<br /> Sidereal and Abyssal Exalted. In contrast to these tiny<br /> numbers, there are more than ten thousand Terrestrial<br /> Exalted in Creation - in the Realm, there is roughly one<br /> Terrestrial Exalt for every five thousand citizens, and this<br /> doesn\u2019t count Outcastes, Exalted inhabitants of Lookshy<br /> or the rural bloodlines of the Northern Threshold nobility. </div> </div> </div>Now this is again, the 1e STC. Numbers have for sure changed in some areas, such as the DB population. But note that it's in teh &quot;abouts&quot; more than the &quot;is fixed at&quot;. To my understanding based on the current devs, it's something like this:<ul><li>Around 150 Solars</li> <li>Around 100 Abyssals</li> <li>50 Infernals</li> <li>100 Sidereals</li> <li>Between 300-400 Lunars</li> <li>Around 25,000 Dragon-Blooded</li> <li>Around 250 Liminals</li> <li>Less than 250 Exigents</li> </ul><br /> <br /> THough Id obut anywhere in 3e text is going to be slated to state these outright, save the DB census we got in WFHW unless something changes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}